# A facing one of the Biosystems Lab's big capsules (F1, the left wing).
# ProcessAButAction (ps2.asm:19806) only asks Level_ChkTargetInteract for
# an object in front; the capsules are map blocks with nothing placed on
# them (SpriteData_BiosystemsLabF1 is three chests), so it is loc_D9AA:
# $1708, "There seems to be nothing unusual here." -- the ROM has no
# capsule message of its own. Not a fix; it answers the question.

start level $34 5 30
wait idle
press right                  # the capsule at 6-7, 28-31 stops the step
wait idle
expect level $34 5 30
press a
wait idle
expect script $1708
shot 01_nothing_unusual
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
